---
import LandingLayout from '../layouts/LandingLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<LandingLayout title="Early Watch — Veille LCB-FT">

<nav>
  <span class="logo">Early<em>Watch</em></span>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="#fonctionnalites">Fonctionnalites</a>
    <a href="#procedures">Procedures</a>
    <a href="#tarifs">Tarifs</a>
  </div>
  <a href="mailto:maria@early.consulting" class="nav-cta">Demander une demo</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero">
  <h1>Le seul outil FR/EU qui fait le lien entre la veille et vos procedures LCB-FT</h1>
  <div class="hero-body">
    <p class="hero-sub">27 sources reglementaires surveillees en continu. Chaque evolution mappee sur vos procedures internes. Pour PSP, CASP, EME et fintechs.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="mailto:maria@early.consulting" class="link-underline">Demander une demo</a>
      <p class="hero-note">
        1 500 a 3 000 EUR / mois<br>
        Scaleway Paris · RGPD-compliant
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- FEATURES -->
<div class="text-sec" id="fonctionnalites">
  <div class="text-sec-grid">
    <div class="sec-label">01 — Ce qu'on fait</div>
    <div class="sec-content">
      <h2>De la publication officielle a l'action, en quelques minutes.</h2>
      <div class="feat-list">
        <div class="feat-item">
          <h3>Veille 27 sources en continu</h3>
          <p>ACPR, AMF, EBA, AMLA, Tracfin, DG Tresor, GAFI, ESMA, CNIL. Chaque article score, tague par theme reglementaire et classe par niveau d'impact sur vos obligations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-item">
          <h3>Reminders automatiques sur vos procedures</h3>
          <p>Quand l'ACPR sanctionne pour defaut de monitoring, vous recevez un reminder cible sur EB-MON-001 avec l'article source, les obligations CMF citees et le niveau de severite.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-item">
          <h3>19 procedures LCB-FT incluses</h3>
          <p>Templates fact-checkes sur sources primaires Legifrance. Format Word pret a personnaliser. Badge d'alerte si une procedure validee est impactee par un nouvel article.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-item">
          <h3>Suivi des validations et piste d'audit</h3>
          <p>Chaque procedure porte un statut. L'historique des validations constitue votre piste d'audit en cas de controle ACPR ou AMF. Export PDF en un clic.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PIPELINE -->
<div class="text-sec">
  <div class="text-sec-grid">
    <div class="sec-label">02 — Comment ca marche</div>
    <div class="sec-content">
      <h2>Du texte reglementaire a <strong>l'action precise.</strong></h2>
      <div class="pipeline">
        <div class="pipeline-item">
          <div class="p-num">01</div>
          <div class="p-body"><h3>Ingestion horaire</h3><p>38 sources surveillees toutes les heures. RSS natif ou scraper. <a href="/coverage" class="link-underline">Tableau de couverture transparent</a> disponible.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pipeline-item">
          <div class="p-num">02</div>
          <div class="p-body"><h3>Analyse des obligations</h3><p>Extraction des articles CMF cites (L.561-32, L.561-6...), du type d'impact, de la severite et des procedures concernees.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pipeline-item">
          <div class="p-num">03</div>
          <div class="p-body"><h3>Mapping sur vos procedures</h3><p>Les obligations extraites sont mappees automatiquement sur les procedures de votre bibliotheque.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pipeline-item">
          <div class="p-num">04</div>
          <div class="p-body"><h3>Reminder dans votre dashboard</h3><p>Message clair, procedure concernee, article source. Alerte email immediate si severite critique ou elevee.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PROCEDURES -->
<div class="text-sec" id="procedures">
  <div class="text-sec-grid">
    <div class="sec-label">03 — Bibliotheque LCB-FT</div>
    <div class="sec-content">
      <h2>19 procedures <strong>fact-checkees</strong> sur sources primaires.</h2>
      <div class="proc-item"><span class="proc-name">Politique generale LCB-FT</span><span class="proc-ref">EB-POL-001 v1.2</span></div>
      <div class="proc-item"><span class="proc-name">Classification des risques LCB-FT</span><span class="proc-ref">EB-RISK-001 v1.2</span></div>
      <div class="proc-item"><span class="proc-name">Entree en relation — Personne physique</span><span class="proc-ref">EB-KYC-001 v1.0</span></div>
      <div class="proc-item"><span class="proc-name">Entree en relation — Personne morale</span><span class="proc-ref">EB-KYC-002 v1.0</span></div>
      <div class="proc-item"><span class="proc-name">Criblage sanctions et PPE</span><span class="proc-ref">EB-SCR-001 v1.1</span></div>
      <div class="proc-item"><span class="proc-name">Monitoring transactionnel</span><span class="proc-ref">EB-MON-001 v1.1</span></div>
      <div class="proc-item"><span class="proc-name">Declaration de soupcon Tracfin</span><span class="proc-ref">EB-TRC-001 v1.1</span></div>
      <div class="proc-item"><span class="proc-name">LCB-FT specifique CASP / PSAN</span><span class="proc-ref">EB-CASP-001 v1.1</span></div>
      <div class="proc-item"><span class="proc-name">Controle permanent LCB-FT</span><span class="proc-ref">EB-CTRL-001 v1.3</span></div>
      <div class="proc-item"><span class="proc-name">Agents et distributeurs LCB-FT</span><span class="proc-ref">EB-AGT-001 v1.3</span></div>
      <p class="proc-more">+ 9 autres — UBO · EDD · PEP · Gel des avoirs · Archivage · Travel Rule · Chargeback · Formation</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PRICING -->
<div class="text-sec" id="tarifs">
  <div class="text-sec-grid">
    <div class="sec-label">04 — Tarifs</div>
    <div class="sec-content">
      <h2>Simple <strong>et previsible.</strong></h2>
      <div class="pricing">
        <div class="price-item">
          <div>
            <div class="price-tier">Essentiel</div>
            <div class="price-amount">1 500</div>
            <div class="price-mo">EUR / mois HT</div>
          </div>
          <ul class="price-feats">
            <li>Dashboard veille 38 sources</li>
            <li>Scoring et tagging automatique</li>
            <li>Filtres par type d'assujetti</li>
            <li>Module newsletter optionnel</li>
            <li>1 utilisateur</li>
          </ul>
          <div><a href="mailto:maria@early.consulting" class="price-cta">Commencer</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="price-item">
          <div>
            <div class="price-tier">Procedures — Recommande</div>
            <div class="price-amount">2 000</div>
            <div class="price-mo">EUR / mois HT</div>
          </div>
          <ul class="price-feats">
            <li>Tout le niveau Essentiel</li>
            <li>19 procedures LCB-FT incluses</li>
            <li>Reminders automatiques par procedure</li>
            <li>Suivi des validations et statuts</li>
            <li>Module Controle et badge d'alerte</li>
            <li>3 utilisateurs</li>
          </ul>
          <div><a href="mailto:maria@early.consulting" class="price-cta">Demander une demo</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="price-item">
          <div>
            <div class="price-tier">Premium</div>
            <div class="price-amount">3 000</div>
            <div class="price-mo">EUR / mois HT</div>
          </div>
          <ul class="price-feats">
            <li>Tout le niveau Procedures</li>
            <li>Generation de procedures sur mesure</li>
            <li>DORA · AI Act · PSD3</li>
            <li>Piste d'audit exportable PDF</li>
            <li>Support prioritaire et onboarding</li>
            <li>Utilisateurs illimites</li>
          </ul>
          <div><a href="mailto:maria@early.consulting" class="price-cta">Nous contacter</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="engage-grid">
        <div class="engage-item">
          <h4>Human-in-the-loop</h4>
          <p>Aucun output IA n'atteint vos utilisateurs sans validation humaine. Principe non negociable.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="engage-item">
          <h4>Souverainete europeenne</h4>
          <p>Heberge sur Scaleway Paris. RGPD-compliant. Aucune donnee hors Union europeenne.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="engage-item">
          <h4>Fact-checked sur Legifrance</h4>
          <p>Chaque procedure verifiee sur sources primaires. CMF, arrete 6 jan. 2021, AMLR.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- CTA -->
<div class="cta-final">
  <h2>Pret a savoir exactement ce que vous devez faire <strong>quand la reglementation bouge ?</strong></h2>
  <div class="cta-links">
    <a href="mailto:maria@early.consulting" class="link-underline">Demander une demo</a>
    <span class="cta-sub">Reponse sous 24h · Demo en visio 30 min</span>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="left">Early<em>Watch</em> — par Early Brief</div>
  <div class="right">
    <a href="#">Mentions legales</a>
    <a href="#">RGPD</a>
    <a href={`${base}login`}>Acces client</a>
  </div>
  <p class="foot-infra">Scaleway Paris · Souverainete europeenne · RGPD-compliant</p>
</footer>

</LandingLayout>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --bg: #F5F0E8;
    --ink: #1C1C19;
    --dim: #6B6860;
    --kaki: #6B7A5E;
    --terra: #C4603A;
    --line: rgba(28,28,25,0.12);
  }
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }

  /* ── NAV ── */
  nav {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    padding: 0 60px; height: 56px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    background: rgba(245,240,232,0.94);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .logo { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
  .logo em { color: var(--terra); font-style: normal; }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 32px; }
  .nav-links a { font-size: 13px; color: var(--dim); letter-spacing: 0.01em; transition: color .15s; }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--kaki); }
  .nav-cta { font-size: 13px; color: var(--dim); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dim); padding-bottom: 1px; transition: all .15s; }
  .nav-cta:hover { color: var(--kaki); border-color: var(--kaki); }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  .hero { padding: 80px 60px 72px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 3.8vw, 52px); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -1.5px; max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .hero-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .hero-sub { font-size: 16px; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.85; font-weight: 300; max-width: 500px; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 8px; }
  .hero-note { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.7; }
  .link-underline { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); padding-bottom: 1px; display: inline-block; transition: all .15s; }
  .link-underline:hover { color: var(--kaki); border-color: var(--kaki); opacity: 1; }

  /* ── TEXT SECTIONS ── */
  .text-sec { padding: 100px 60px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .text-sec-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr; gap: 60px; }
  .sec-label { font-size: 14px; color: var(--kaki); font-weight: 500; padding-top: 4px; }
  .sec-content h2 { font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 26px); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.3px; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .sec-content h2 strong { font-weight: 600; }

  /* ── FEATURES ── */
  .feat-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .feat-item { padding: 32px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .feat-item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .feat-item h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: -0.2px; }
  .feat-item p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.8; font-weight: 300; max-width: 600px; }

  /* ── PIPELINE ── */
  .pipeline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .pipeline-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr; gap: 28px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .pipeline-item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .p-num { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--kaki); padding-top: 3px; font-weight: 500; }
  .p-body h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .p-body p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.75; font-weight: 300; }

  /* ── PROCEDURES ── */
  .proc-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 100px; padding: 18px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); gap: 16px; }
  .proc-item:last-of-type { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .proc-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 300; }
  .proc-ref { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--kaki); text-align: right; padding-top: 3px; }
  .proc-more { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--dim); padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }

  /* ── PRICING ── */
  .pricing { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .price-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr 200px; gap: 48px; padding: 40px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); align-items: start; }
  .price-item:last-of-type { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .price-tier { font-size: 12px; color: var(--dim); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.02em; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .price-amount { font-size: 40px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -2px; line-height: 1; }
  .price-mo { font-size: 13px; color: var(--dim); margin-top: 4px; }
  .price-feats { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .price-feats li { font-size: 14px; color: var(--dim); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.5; padding-left: 16px; position: relative; }
  .price-feats li::before { content: '\2014'; position: absolute; left: 0; font-size: 11px; color: var(--kaki); }
  .price-cta { display: inline-block; font-size: 13px; padding-bottom: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--kaki); color: var(--kaki); }
  .price-cta:hover { opacity: .6; }

  /* ── ENGAGEMENTS ── */
  .engage-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 48px; margin-top: 64px; padding-top: 56px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .engage-item h4 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .engage-item p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.8; font-weight: 300; }

  /* ── CTA FINAL ── */
  .cta-final { padding: 80px 60px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .cta-final h2 { font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 30px); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 32px; max-width: 560px; }
  .cta-final h2 strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .cta-links { display: flex; gap: 36px; align-items: center; }
  .cta-sub { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--dim); }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  footer { padding: 28px 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  footer .left { font-size: 13px; }
  footer .left em { color: var(--terra); font-style: normal; }
  footer .right { display: flex; gap: 28px; }
  footer .right a { font-size: 12px; color: var(--dim); }
  footer .right a:hover { color: var(--kaki); }
  .foot-infra { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--dim); width: 100%; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    nav, .hero, .text-sec, .cta-final, footer { padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; }
    .hero h1 { letter-spacing: -1.5px; }
    .figures { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .text-sec-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    .price-item { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
    .engage-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    .cta-links { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
  }
</style>
